msgstr "Gaming mouse configuration utility (Piper fork)"

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:13
msgid ""
"Piper by AKGeilani-tech is a fork of Piper, the graphical user interface to "
"configure gaming mice, maintained by Ahmed Geilani. The original Piper "
"project was created by the libratbag developers."
msgstr ""
"Piper by AKGeilani-tech is a fork of Piper, the graphical user interface to "
"configure gaming mice, maintained by Ahmed Geilani. The original Piper "
"project was created by the libratbag developers."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:18
msgid ""
"Configuration options include changing the resolution (DPI) of the mouse, "
"adding and removing profiles, setting LED colors and changing button "
"behaviors."
msgstr ""
"Configuration options include changing the resolution (DPI) of the mouse, "
"adding and removing profiles, setting LED colors and changing button "
"behaviors."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:23
msgid ""
"Piper requires libratbag’s ratbagd, the daemon to actually communicate with "
"the mice. Piper is merely a front end to ratbagd, ratbagd must be installed "
"and running when Piper is launched."
msgstr ""
"Piper requires libratbag’s ratbagd, the daemon to actually communicate with "
"the mice. Piper is merely a front end to ratbagd, ratbagd must be installed "
"and running when Piper is launched."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:34
msgid "The button configuraton page"
msgstr "The button configuraton page"

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:38
msgid "The LED configuraton page"
msgstr "The LED configuraton page"

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:42
msgid "The resolution configuraton page"
msgstr "The resolution configuraton page"

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:61
msgid ""
"Add a Settings dialog with a global keyboard shortcut to cycle through mouse "
"profiles."
msgstr ""
"Add a Settings dialog with a global keyboard shortcut to cycle through mouse "
"profiles."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:62
msgid ""
"Add a mouse selector with hotplug detection and a second shortcut to switch "
"between mice."
msgstr ""
"Add a mouse selector with hotplug detection and a second shortcut to switch "
"between mice."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:63
msgid ""
"Add Dark, Light and System color modes plus automatic startup and minimize-"
"to-tray options."
msgstr ""
"Add Dark, Light and System color modes plus automatic startup and minimize-"
"to-tray options."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:64
msgid "Add a system tray icon and a Quit menu entry."
msgstr "Add a system tray icon and a Quit menu entry."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:65
msgid ""
"Add tray actions and retry registration when the desktop tray is not ready "
"at login."
msgstr ""
"Add tray actions and retry registration when the desktop tray is not ready "
"at login."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:66
msgid ""
"Warn about devices with partial ratbagd/libratbag support and disable saving "
"for them."
msgstr ""
"Warn about devices with partial ratbagd/libratbag support and disable saving "
"for them."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:67
msgid "Support single-profile mice in the profile selector."
msgstr "Support single-profile mice in the profile selector."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:68
msgid "Handle the Breeze/Breeze-Dark GTK themes and live system color changes."
msgstr ""
"Handle the Breeze/Breeze-Dark GTK themes and live system color changes."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:69
msgid ""
"Reconnect automatically when ratbagd exits after idle and keep it alive "
"while Piper runs."
msgstr ""
"Reconnect automatically when ratbagd exits after idle and keep it alive "
"while Piper runs."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:70
msgid "Allow renaming profiles and persist the names across restarts."
msgstr "Allow renaming profiles and persist the names across restarts."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:71
msgid "Ship complete English and Spanish translations."
msgstr "Ship complete English and Spanish translations."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:72
msgid "Fix reuse of the Ratbagd instance at startup."
msgstr "Fix reuse of the Ratbagd instance at startup."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:73
msgid "Run the test suite in CI and pin the main workflow actions by commit."
msgstr "Run the test suite in CI and pin the main workflow actions by commit."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:74
msgid "Validate GTK and Rsvg at configure time."
msgstr "Validate GTK and Rsvg at configure time."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:75
msgid ""
"Update the Flatpak runtime and dependencies and make the build reproducible."
msgstr ""
"Update the Flatpak runtime and dependencies and make the build reproducible."

